      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Argath, Bastion of Illdaera [zone=806]\n**Who:**\n- Risathron [npc=38132]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 90\n**Maximum Level:** | 95\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Loot\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- an Argathian traitor [npc=38234]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Nov 15 16:56:45 2011\nModified: Sat Feb 8 15:50:13 2020 | | _For an overview of the Veil of Alaris expansion, a task listing, and information about group/raid progression, spells, and armor, **click here**._\n\n---\n\n_This is a kill task that begins with Risathron in Argath. He's found in the southwestern part of the zone (below the crown) at about -990, -190, -272._\nYou say, 'Hail, Risathron'\nRisathron says 'Greetings, outsider! We need your [help]!'\nYou say, 'How can I help?'\nRisathron says 'As an Argathian myself, I am ashamed. I despise seeing many Argathians [turning their back] against their own home and swearing allegiances to the Erillion!'\nYou say, 'Turning their back?'\nRisathron says 'Numerous homes were destroyed by the Forge fires. With the Erillion's troops occupying the Belly, many Argathians sided with the invaders hoping to escape [death].'\nYou say, 'Death?'\nRisathron says 'They betrayed us to escape death, I need you to give them death! Kill those despicable traitors for pledging loyalty to Erillion and working to sabotage Argath's defenses!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Gone Traitors Gone'.\nHoping to escape death, some Argathians turned their back against their homeland. Riathron has requested your assistance to remove these pests.\n\n---\n\nKill 10 Argathian traitors 0/10 (Argath)\n_These mobs can be found most commonly in the KOS sections of the \"arms\", and less commonly in the \"belly\"._\nSpeak with Risathron 0/1 (Argath)\nYou say, 'Hail, Risathron'\nRisathron says 'These traitors will no longer hurt us.'\n_Reward:_\nTightly Wrapped Stack of Flash Cards\n106pp\nExperience\n- Tightly Wrapped Stack of Flash Cards [item=97973]",
