      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Argath, Bastion of Illdaera [zone=806]\n**Who:**\n- Supplykeeper Proxipid [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 90\n**Maximum Level:** | 95\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a greedy looter [npc=38223]\n- a hungry thief [npc=38224]\n**Era:** | !Veil of Alaris\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Nov 15 16:57:14 2011\nModified: Sat Feb 8 15:50:13 2020 | | _For an overview of the Veil of Alaris expansion, a task listing, and information about group/raid progression, spells, and armor, **click here**._\n\n---\n\n_This is a kill task that begins with Supplykeeper Proxipid in Argath. He's found in the southwestern part of the zone (below the crown) at about -990, -190, -272._\nYou say, 'Hail, Supplykeeper Proxipid'\nSupplykeeper Proxipid says 'Pardon me. You're not here to [steal] our supplies, are you?'\nYou say, 'Me? Steal from you?'\nSupplykeeper Proxipid says 'You look not to be Argathians. It is rather shameful, our [supplies] have been looted by our fellow Argathians in the midst of battle. The siege by the forces of Erillion brought hunger to the citizens of Argath. Some turned to looting just to survive.'\nYou say, 'What supplies?'\nSupplykeeper Proxipid says 'With the lack of supplies, Argath will not stand. Thieves and looters hath been taking food and valuables from us. Reasoning exists not in this time of crisis. I could use you to make a push and [kill] them for Argath.'\nYou say, 'I'll kill them'\nSupplykeeper Proxipid says 'Excellent! Looters and thieves can be found on the Arms of Argath.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Secure From Within'.\nSupplies are being emptied from within Argath's fortress by greedy looters and hungry thieves. You're now asked to kill greedy looters and hungry thieves to ensure adequate resources for the battle.\n\n---\n\nKill 5 greedy looters 0/5 (Argath)\nKill 5 hungry thieves 0/5 (Argath)\n_These mobs are found in and around the buildings in the northeastern and southeastern areas of the \"arms\" (the same level as the kill task givers)._\nSpeak with Supplykeeper Proxipid 0/1 (Argath)\n( **Closing dialogues?**)\n_Reward:_\nThin Dusty Tome\n- Thin Dusty Tome [item=97972]",
